  "question": {
    "text": "Let $A$ and $B$ denote the statements\nA: $\\cos \\alpha+\\cos \\beta+\\cos \\gamma=0$\nB: $\\sin \\alpha+\\sin \\beta+\\sin \\gamma=0$\nIf $\\cos (\\beta-\\gamma)+\\cos (\\gamma-\\alpha)+\\cos (\\alpha-\\beta)=-\\frac{3}{2}$, then",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "0nfcI",
      "text": "\n$A$ is true and $B$ is false\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ZZaf6",
      "text": "\n$A$ is false and $B$ is true\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "hBSWi",
      "text": "\nboth $A$ and $B$ are true\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "zm4eD",
      "text": "\nboth $A$ and $B$ are false",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\cos (\\beta-\\gamma)+\\cos (\\gamma-\\alpha)+\\cos (\\alpha-\\beta)=-\\frac{3}{2} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 2[\\cos (\\beta-\\gamma)+\\cos (\\gamma-\\alpha)+\\cos (\\alpha-\\beta)]+3=0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 2[\\cos (\\beta-\\gamma)+\\cos (\\gamma-\\alpha)+\\cos (\\alpha-\\beta)]+\\sin ^2 \\alpha+\\cos ^2 \\alpha+\\sin ^2 \\beta+\\cos ^2 \\beta+\\sin ^2 \\gamma+\\cos ^2 \\gamma=0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow(\\sin \\alpha+\\sin \\beta+\\sin \\gamma)^2+(\\cos \\alpha+\\cos \\beta+\\cos \\gamma)^2=0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
